                  "paragraph": {
                    "rich_text": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": {
                          "content": "All that said, Trevor, I think you're jumping the gun here. I already thought this with your original post on ineffectiveness, which on one hand asked important questions which I'm grateful for, but on the other (IMO) didn't give Aaron/Lumina enough time to respond. It calls to mind the recent Nonlinear drama and TracingWoodgrain's critiques of the post: ",
                          "link": null
